                        <h3 class="transition-colors text-decoration-transparent group-hover:text-decoration-current group-focus:text-decoration-current">As Europe shifts to clean energy, does it still need so much <span class="caps">US</span>&nbsp;<span class="caps">LNG</span>?</h3>
